BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (contact, then document collection. Spend on the next stage only when the prior stage supports a plausible claim.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Illustratively, reviewing 200 records at three minutes each requires ten hours; at a $35 loaded hourly rate, discovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (costs $350. If twenty records survive, assign a $0.25 budget ceiling per initial commercial address check, adding $5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (rather than enriching all 200. Those are internal planning assumptions, not quoted vendor prices. If five prospects then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (require twenty minutes of authority review, another $58.33 brings cohort research cost to $413.33 before outreach and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (claim preparation. Stop when expected collectible fees cannot cover the remaining workload. Matching scores must) Tj ET
